# Example data stack for "ccusb daq" / the GUI's DAQ tab.
# Reads the 8 channels of the simulator's ADC in station 7.
#
#   read N A F [long] [lam]        write N A F DATA [long]
#   control N A F                  marker VALUE
#   qstop|qscan|repeat N A F MAX [long] [lam]
read 7 0 0
read 7 1 0
read 7 2 0
read 7 3 0
read 7 4 0
read 7 5 0
read 7 6 0
read 7 7 2      # F2 on the last channel also clears the module
marker 0xEEEE   # end-of-event marker
